  "title": "Civic Participation Under Survival Demands",
  "concept": "People facing survival demands may find it unclear what matters to them or whether civic options, if any, fit their circumstances and can plausibly influence outcomes they care about.",
  "generatedAt": "2026-07-26T23:36:14.624Z",
